{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07706","headline":"游明禅师西山兰若 · 孟浩然","name":"游明禅师西山兰若","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西山多奇状，秀出倚前楹。\n停午收彩翠，夕阳照分明。\n吾师住其下，禅坐证无生。\n结庐就嵌窟，剪苕通往行。\n谈空对樵叟，授法与山精。\n日暮方辞去，田园归冶城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}